Nian Comes to Town — Red Paper-cut (PolarMotion demo)
All visuals are procedurally generated in code (Canvas2D): paper textures, cut patterns, characters, village, lighting. No images or footage used.

Fonts
- Fraunces by Undercase Type (Phaedra Charles, Flavia Zimbardi) — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL-Fraunces.txt)
- Ma Shan Zheng by Ma Shan Zheng — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL-MaShanZheng.txt)

Voice
- Synthetic narration.

Music (original composition, music/score.py)
- Sampled instruments: flute, dan tranh, woodblock, gong, frame drum, erhu
- Pipa: physical-model plucked string (core/audio/pluck.py), original synthesis

Sound effects
- All synthesized in mix.py (numpy / scipy), original.

